# Inventura: frontend rules (static PWA + Tailwind)

- Frontend is static PWA: keep pages in repository root and logic in `js/`.
- Prefer adding pages under existing filenames instead of creating new top-level files.

Styling:
- Edit `tailwind.input.css` and regenerate `assets/tailwind.css` as documented.
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes; avoid introducing a JS CSS framework.

Service worker / PWA:
- When changing `sw.js`, document cache keys and migration strategy.
- Test offline-first flows after any caching change.

API calls:
- Use configured Supabase helper in `js/supabase.js` when available.
